  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><span>Using Snell&rsquo;s law for the refraction at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>AC</mi></math>, we get</span></p><p><span style=\"position:relative;top:0.0pt\">&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi><mtext>&#8201;&#8201;</mtext><mi>sini</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mtext>&#8201;&#8201;</mtext><mi>sinr</mi></math> </span></p><p><span style=\"position:relative;top:0.0pt\">&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>sin</mi><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>sinr</mi></math> </span></p><p><span style=\"position:relative;top:0.0pt\">&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>sinr</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math> </span></p><p><span style=\"position:relative;top:0.0pt\">&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mtext>&#8201;&#8201;&#8201;&#8201;&#8201;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>45</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math> </span></p><p><span style=\"position:relative;top:0.0pt\">&nbsp;<math> <mo>&#8756;</mo> </math> </span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Angle of deviation &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>45</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math> </span></p><p align=\"left\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/WhatsApp_Image_2020-05-28_at_6.59.09_PM.jpeg\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 177px;\" /></p>",
